# Cursor rules

This is the **weisssrv-app-template** copier template — it generates tenant
repositories, it does not deploy anything. Read [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) before
making any change; it is the canonical agent doc (also enforced by
`.cursor/rules/template-development.mdc`, `alwaysApply: true`).

The rules that must hold in every change:

- NEVER commit secrets, in the template or in a fixture.
- NEVER push to `main` — branch → merge request, always.
- NEVER hardcode site identity (domains, registry hosts, node labels, VIPs,
  runner tags) under `template/` — they are copier answers.
- NEVER edit a vendored library copy; fix it in weisssrv-lib and re-vendor.
- Adding a component means the manifest, its conditional path, its
  `kustomization.yaml` line, and a render assertion.
- Run `python3 -m pytest tests` before opening a merge request.
